  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that models using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and transformer/concat fusion (config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.7207). This experiment tests pca_n2000 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder, maintaining transformer aggregation and concat fusion. It clarifies whether the RNA encoder or image encoder choice is more critical, while keeping other high-performing components. This balances exploitation (building on proven components) and exploration (testing RNA/image encoder alternatives) under the remaining budget."
